        "original_id": "f579a832-ecf1-5ba1-a672-496e9ec5fba0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jim Keller\n- Companies: AMD, Apple Inc., Samsung\n- Products: AMD K8 microarchitecture, Athlon 64, Athlon (K7), Apple A4, Apple A5\n- Concepts: 32-bit package on package (PoP) system-on-a-chip (SoC)\n\nFacts:\n- Jim Keller was involved in designing the Athlon (K7) processors.\n- Jim Keller was the lead architect of the AMD K8 microarchitecture, including the original Athlon 64.\n- Jim Keller was involved in designing the Apple A4 and Apple A5 processors.\n- Apple Inc. designed the Apple A4 as a 32-bit package on package system-on-a-chip.\n- Samsung manufactured the Apple A4.",
